  - given-names: Pablo
    family-names: "González"
    affiliation: "University of Oviedo, Spain"
repository-code: "https://github.com/coastal-AI/Intertidal_analysis"
keywords:
  - intertidal topography
  - emerged time
  - Sentinel-2
  - openEO
  - tidal delay
  - estuaries
  - remote sensing
  - Zostera noltei
abstract: >-
  MAREA maps intertidal elevation, its uncertainty and emerged time at 10 m
  from the Sentinel-2 archive. It reads from the images one delay of the tide
  for each 3-km section along the channel (zero at the mouth, never
  decreasing inland), shifts the tide at the mouth by that delay, and then
  fits the elevation of every pixel. The validation is in progress; the
  repository reports no validation result.
